{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CfR8E3ZfyicssP8i3XPpr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`/app/answers.json` is written and valid. Summary of what I found and answered:\n\n**q1 — n = 41.** The PPO recipe `kl=6.44235 steps=470` actually reaches KL = 2.738 (not 6.44: the `kl` knob is the cap, and KL(steps) = kl·(1−exp(−steps/849)) with steps0 fit from the notebook's two kl=2.899 runs and confirmed by my run). Solving log n − (n−1)/n = 2.738 gives n = 41.00 (exact integer; the notes' n=628 used log n and the target KL rather than the reached KL).\n\n**q2 — 0.386.** I swept `len_pen` at four KL levels (~220 train runs) and fitted proxy = wq·d + wl·tanh((len−len0)/sl) jointly: len0 ≈ 282 (measured directly from bon n=1), sl ≈ 109, wl ≈ 0.554, wq ≈ 0.531, residuals at the seed-noise level. At the ship recipe (len ≈ 782, tanh saturated) the length term is 0.554 of the 1.435 proxy reward → 0.386.\n\n**q3 — plan.** Two gold runs, `bon n=41` and the PPO recipe, each at gold_n=5500 (2200 each, 4400 total); rule `bon.gold_win_rate − ppo.gold_win_rate`, cuts `> 0.1 → bon`, `< −0.1 → ppo`, else `undetermined`. Difference SE ≈ 0.0095, which is the best separation the budget buys; gold win rate is the only statistic not derived from the reward model, so it distinguishes worlds that differ in the proxy–gold divergence.\n\n**q4 — ppo_light.** Under the stated gold laws, bon_a/bon_b are dominated unless overoptimization is negligible, and ppo_light beats ppo_ship whenever the RL gold peak lies below d ≈ 1.5. My one gold evaluation of the ship recipe (14/50, win rate 0.28) indicates the ship recipe is already well past the gold peak, so the lighter recipe wins.\n\nOne caveat to flag honestly: I exhausted the 240-request limit on cheap train runs before doing a larger gold evaluation, so q4 rests on the single 50-comparison gold measurement plus the functional forms rather than on a direct gold comparison of the four recipes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":178,"cache_read_input_tokens":55722,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":178},"output_tokens":814,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0b97c227-d9bc-4e54-a106-6ebf02e059e6","uuid":"443fc032-3504-4259-a675-2da3259014bb","timestamp":"2026-09-26T00:44:36.479Z"}
